From: Marcin FM <marcin@lgic.pl>
Subject: [PATCH] Discover ONNX Runtime in Fedora lib64

Include Fedora's architecture-specific library location in Xberg's existing
dynamic ONNX Runtime discovery path.

Fedora-specific; not submitted upstream. Local Xberg history has no released
Fedora lib64 discovery change.

diff --git a/crates/xberg/src/ort_discovery.rs b/crates/xberg/src/ort_discovery.rs
--- a/crates/xberg/src/ort_discovery.rs
+++ b/crates/xberg/src/ort_discovery.rs
@@ -67,0 +68 @@ fn platform_candidates() -> &'static [&'static str] {
+        "/usr/lib64/libonnxruntime.so",
